/A 2620 0 R
/Alt (Diagram illustrating a variational autoencoder architecture with an encoder reducing a 26 by 26 by 3 input to latent space, applying Gaussian noise, then a decoder reconstructing the output. Key operations include 3 by 3 convolution at sixty-four channels with max pooling and Conv2DTranspose with upsampling. Output loss is calculated as the squared difference between input and reconstruction.)
